
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Order as Order<br/>transaction
  participant Redis as Redis<br/>cart state
  participant ODB as PostgreSQL<br/>Order DB

  Order->>Redis: Read cart and<br/>validate version
  alt Cart version mismatch or empty
    Redis-->>Order: Conflict or no items
    Order-->>Order: Reject submit
  else Cart valid and version matches
    Redis-->>Order: Cart snapshot
    Order->>ODB: Begin transaction
    Order->>ODB: Lock session by<br/>tenant + sessionId
    Order->>ODB: Create PENDING order<br/>+ line items from cart
    alt Open bill exists
      Order->>ODB: Link order to bill
    else No open bill
      Order->>ODB: Create OPEN bill<br/>link order
    end
    Order->>ODB: Commit transaction
    ODB-->>Order: Order committed
    Order->>Redis: Delete cart
    Redis-->>Order: Cart cleared
  end

  Note over Order,Redis: Stock NOT deducted here. Order stays PENDING until staff confirms via Order Confirm Saga (Section 5.4).

